WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.234
-Welcome, welcome, welcome to
"The Tonight Show"!

00:00:03.234 --> 00:00:05.000
You're here. You made it.
Thank you for watching.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:08.434 --> 00:00:09.634
Well, guys, this is fun.

00:00:09.634 --> 00:00:12.167
Today is National
Aunt and Uncles Day.

00:00:12.167 --> 00:00:13.767
[ Cheers and applause ]
Yeah.

00:00:13.767 --> 00:00:15.300
I love my aunts and uncles.

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:16.734
They've taught me so much,

00:00:16.734 --> 00:00:20.200
like the difference between
wine drunk and beer drunk.

00:00:21.234 --> 00:00:22.667
Hey, everyone's
talking about this.

00:00:22.667 --> 00:00:24.200
Tonight's Mega Millions jackpot

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:28.300
is one of the biggest ever,
at nearly $1 billion.

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:33.267
If you forgot to buy a ticket,
congrats, you just won $2.

00:00:34.067 --> 00:00:36.067
Yep, by tonight,
some lucky person

00:00:36.067 --> 00:00:37.534
is gonna gain
millions of dollars

00:00:37.534 --> 00:00:40.067
and hundreds of new cousins.

00:00:40.067 --> 00:00:42.601
"Hey, happy Aunt And Uncles Day.
Remember me?"

00:00:42.601 --> 00:00:44.367
That's right --
nearly a billion dollars.

00:00:44.367 --> 00:00:45.801
Yeah, that kind of
money's a lot of pressure.

00:00:45.801 --> 00:00:47.267
I mean, if you win that,
next thing you know,

00:00:47.267 --> 00:00:49.167
you're buying Twitter
and having an affair with

00:00:49.167 --> 00:00:50.901
the founder of Google's wife,
you know?

00:00:50.901 --> 00:00:53.601
It's just --
It's a slippery slope.

00:00:53.601 --> 00:00:55.033
Let's get to some news
here, guys.

00:00:55.033 --> 00:00:56.801
As he continues to
recover from COVID,

00:00:56.801 --> 00:00:59.501
President Biden told reporters
he's sleeping so well

00:00:59.501 --> 00:01:02.734
that his dog had to
wake him up yesterday morning.

00:01:02.734 --> 00:01:04.734
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.701 --> 00:01:10.200
And reporters responded with
a very nervous laugh.

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:12.300
They're like...
[ Laughs lightly ]

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:13.801
You know that dog was
kind of freaking out like,

00:01:13.801 --> 00:01:16.167
"Joe? Joe? Joe? Whew."

00:01:16.167 --> 00:01:18.667
You can tell Biden was tired,
'cause he tapped the dog's head

00:01:18.667 --> 00:01:21.968
and told him to come back
nine minutes later.

00:01:21.968 --> 00:01:23.067
More news from The White House.

00:01:23.067 --> 00:01:24.501
I read that
to fight climate change,

00:01:24.501 --> 00:01:25.968
the Biden administration
has pledged

00:01:25.968 --> 00:01:28.300
to plant 1 billion trees.

00:01:28.300 --> 00:01:30.200
Yep. And just
for fun, they're planting them

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:32.701
in the middle of Trump's
golf course at Mar-a-Lago.

00:01:32.701 --> 00:01:35.801
[ Cheers and applause ]
Right in the middle.

00:01:39.234 --> 00:01:40.734
Meanwhile, this morning,
Biden woke up from

00:01:40.734 --> 00:01:45.100
his COVID fever like,
"Did I order a billion trees?"

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:46.801
I'm sorry. Uh, yeah? Tariq?

00:01:46.801 --> 00:01:48.434
-Um, yeah, I had a question.

00:01:48.434 --> 00:01:51.000
Well, are they planting
a billion seeds

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:52.133
or a billion trees?

00:01:52.133 --> 00:01:53.334
Because there's a difference.

00:01:53.334 --> 00:01:55.434
-You know what?
I don't really know.

00:01:55.434 --> 00:01:57.000
[ Chuckles ] Yes, Tariq.

00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:01.367
-If I had to guess,
I'd say they're planting seeds.

00:02:01.367 --> 00:02:03.000
♪♪

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:05.300
-'Cause you gotta plant
the seeds to make the trees.

00:02:05.300 --> 00:02:07.334
-And you gotta wet the seeds
to get the leaves.

00:02:07.334 --> 00:02:09.367
-A billion trees
from a billion seeds.

00:02:09.367 --> 00:02:11.601
-We'll be seeing green
from sea-to-sea.

00:02:11.601 --> 00:02:13.801
-So much pollen,
can't help but sneeze.

00:02:13.801 --> 00:02:15.901
-But that's okay,
it's fine by me.

00:02:15.901 --> 00:02:17.934
-'Cause clean air
is what we want to see.

00:02:17.934 --> 00:02:20.234
-To the birds and
the insects and the bumblebees.

00:02:20.234 --> 00:02:22.367
-We'll be oh-so-happy
to enjoy that breeze.

00:02:22.367 --> 00:02:24.501
-A billion trees
from a billion seeds?

00:02:24.501 --> 00:02:26.868
I got one answer,
yes, please.

00:02:26.868 --> 00:02:30.601
-♪ Seeds and trees ♪

00:02:30.601 --> 00:02:32.634
♪ Planting the crops ♪

00:02:32.634 --> 00:02:34.601
♪ Ready or not ♪

00:02:34.601 --> 00:02:37.534
-"Seeds and Trees Mixtape,
2022."

00:02:37.534 --> 00:02:39.367
[ Air horn blows ]

00:02:39.367 --> 00:02:41.367
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:44.667 --> 00:02:47.067
-What is going on?
-Man.

00:02:47.067 --> 00:02:48.868
I saw that -- Guys, today,

00:02:48.868 --> 00:02:51.467
former President Trump returned
to Washington, D.C.,

00:02:51.467 --> 00:02:53.934
for the first time
since leaving office.

00:02:53.934 --> 00:02:55.901
Trump said, "Well,
since I'm still the president,

00:02:55.901 --> 00:02:58.167
it only makes sense I stop by."

00:03:00.767 --> 00:03:04.067
Switching gears, T-Mobile
has agreed to pay its customers

00:03:04.067 --> 00:03:06.601
$350 million in a settlement

00:03:06.601 --> 00:03:08.968
over a massive data breach.

00:03:08.968 --> 00:03:10.734
We actually have
their lawyer on the line

00:03:10.734 --> 00:03:11.868
to explain their settlement.

00:03:11.868 --> 00:03:13.100
Yeah, sir, are you there?

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:15.634
-Hi, Jimmy.
Thank you for having me.

00:03:15.634 --> 00:03:18.634
"Tonight Show"...to be here.

00:03:20.501 --> 00:03:23.234
-Sorry? This is
a massive settlement here,

00:03:23.234 --> 00:03:25.100
so how are you feeling?

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:28.501
-Well, now that...settlement...
completed...

00:03:28.501 --> 00:03:31.267
try to relax...
raspberry custard...

00:03:31.267 --> 00:03:34.734
nipples...that hamster.

00:03:34.734 --> 00:03:36.467
-I'm sorry. You're cutting out.

00:03:36.467 --> 00:03:38.868
Can you say that again?
-Of course.

00:03:38.868 --> 00:03:41.267
I was just saying now that
the settlement is completed,

00:03:41.267 --> 00:03:44.033
I...go home...
raspberry custard...

00:03:44.033 --> 00:03:46.701
nipples...that hamster.

00:03:47.934 --> 00:03:50.067
-Sorry. It's still a bit choppy.

00:03:50.067 --> 00:03:52.100
It's not really making sense.

00:03:52.100 --> 00:03:53.834
Can you switch to Wi-Fi?

00:03:53.834 --> 00:03:56.767
-Uh, sure, Jimmy. How's this?
Can you hear me now?

00:03:56.767 --> 00:03:58.868
-It's much better. Thank you.
-Great.

00:03:58.868 --> 00:04:01.100
I was just saying, now that the
settlement is completed,

00:04:01.100 --> 00:04:02.434
I want to relax.

00:04:02.434 --> 00:04:04.801
I think I might go home
and smear raspberry custard

00:04:04.801 --> 00:04:06.567
on my nipples and let my
pet hamster nibble on it

00:04:06.567 --> 00:04:08.000
